{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14332","headline":"哭吕衡州八郎中 · 窦巩","name":"哭吕衡州八郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今朝血泪问苍苍，不分先悲旅馆丧。\n人送剑来归陇上，鴈飞书去呌衡阳。\n还家路远儿童小，埋玉泉深昼夜长。\n望尽素车秋草外，欲将身赎返魂香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦巩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}